1
00:00:00,149 --> 00:00:07,835
Part 23 mein users aur security: team ki list, naya user invite karna, roles jaise manager,

2
00:00:07,835 --> 00:00:15,522
accountant, billing, warehouse, salesman aur delivery, permission matrix, two-step sign-in,

3
00:00:15,522 --> 00:00:16,873
aur audit trail.

4
00:00:17,841 --> 00:00:20,902
System mein Users and roles kholiye.

5
00:00:20,902 --> 00:00:28,384
Owner, manager aur accountant email, password aur authenticator app se login karte hain.

6
00:00:28,384 --> 00:00:34,421
Warehouse, billing, salesman aur delivery staff employee ID aur PIN se.

7
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:42,775
Team list mein har user ka naam, sign-in ka tareeka, employee ID, two-step on hai ya nahi,

8
00:00:42,775 --> 00:00:44,651
role aur aakhri login.

9
00:00:44,651 --> 00:00:50,023
Hamare demo mein owner ke alawa Ravi salesman, Rahul warehouse,

10
00:00:50,023 --> 00:00:53,264
Manoj delivery aur Pooja billing hain.

11
00:00:53,933 --> 00:00:57,933
Naya user jodte hain: office ka accountant.

12
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:02,212
Full name, email, role Accountant, aur godown.

13
00:01:02,212 --> 00:01:10,026
Accountant ko password aur authenticator chahiye, isliye invite email par jaata hai.

14
00:01:10,026 --> 00:01:12,073
Create invite dabaiye.

15
00:01:12,775 --> 00:01:16,817
Invite code ban gaya, jo 48 ghante tak valid hai.

16
00:01:16,817 --> 00:01:23,004
Employee sign-in page par I have an invite code se apna account banata hai.

17
00:01:23,004 --> 00:01:30,675
Code video mein dikhaya ja sakta hai kyunki yeh demo hai, asli code kisi se share mat kariye.

18
00:01:31,392 --> 00:01:33,331
Ab permission matrix.

19
00:01:33,331 --> 00:01:41,735
Har row ek permission hai: masters, orders book karna, approve karna, credit hold override,

20
00:01:41,735 --> 00:01:49,769
invoice, invoice cancel, pick and pack, dispatch, delivery, purchase, stock adjustment,

21
00:01:49,769 --> 00:01:54,017
payments, reports, insights, portal aur users.

22
00:01:54,017 --> 00:01:55,772
Har column ek role.

23
00:01:56,475 --> 00:02:02,511
Jaise Salesman ke paas sirf orders book karna aur payment collect karna hai.

24
00:02:02,511 --> 00:02:07,117
Woh approve nahi kar sakta, invoice cancel nahi kar sakta.

25
00:02:07,117 --> 00:02:11,802
Kisi cell par click karke permission de ya hata sakte hain.

26
00:02:11,802 --> 00:02:14,423
Owner ki permissions locked hain.

27
00:02:15,090 --> 00:02:22,665
Jaise warehouse role ko stock adjustment ki permission dete hain, aur phir wapas hata dete hain.

28
00:02:22,665 --> 00:02:25,742
Har badlaav audit trail mein jaata hai.

29
00:02:26,402 --> 00:02:28,588
Ab dekhiye role ka asar.

30
00:02:28,588 --> 00:02:33,323
Yeh Ravi salesman ka phone hai, jo PIN se login hai.

31
00:02:33,323 --> 00:02:41,519
Dhyan dijiye: salesman ko bhi dashboard par poori bikri, vasooli aur bakaya dikh raha hai.

32
00:02:41,519 --> 00:02:45,070
Yeh hamari QA report ka ek finding hai.

33
00:02:51,127 --> 00:02:55,332
Ravi users ka page kholne ki koshish karta hai.

34
00:02:55,332 --> 00:02:59,715
Use permission nahi hai, isliye page nahi khulta.

35
00:03:00,368 --> 00:03:04,531
Two-step sign-in owner aur manager ke liye zaroori hai.

36
00:03:04,531 --> 00:03:08,844
Login par password ke baad authenticator ka 6-digit code.

37
00:03:08,844 --> 00:03:13,461
Bharose wale computer ko 30 din ke liye trust kar sakte hain,

38
00:03:13,461 --> 00:03:17,548
aur phone kho jaaye toh recovery codes kaam aate hain.

39
00:03:18,206 --> 00:03:22,318
Neeche Audit trail hai: kisne, kab, kya kiya.

40
00:03:22,318 --> 00:03:29,903
Order approve, credit override, invoice cancel, stock adjustment, permission badli,

41
00:03:29,903 --> 00:03:34,106
supplier payment, sab naam aur samay ke saath.

42
00:03:34,106 --> 00:03:38,218
Audit entries badli ya mitaayi nahi ja sakti.

43
00:03:38,872 --> 00:03:43,713
Sahi role aur permission se har karmchari sirf apna kaam karta hai,

44
00:03:43,713 --> 00:03:50,216
galti ya gadbad ka khatra kam hota hai, aur zaroorat padne par audit trail se poori kahani

45
00:03:50,216 --> 00:03:51,228
mil jaati hai.
